{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05312","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 麴瞻","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扈跸游玄地，陪仙瞰紫微。\n似迈铢衣刼，将同羽化飞。\n雕戈秋日丽，宝劒晓霜霏。\n献觞乘菊序，长愿奉天晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"麴瞻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}